tahta-kilit (0.1.29) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Lock screen: touch button "Hata ayrıntısı / Tanı" shows live service state
    and the automatic diagnosis report; no keyboard or terminal needed.
  * New tahta-kilit-tani.timer (boot + every 2 minutes, root): restarts the
    verifier if it is down and writes /run/bb-kilit-tani/rapor.txt. The
    automatic run never sends a registration request.

