tahta-kilit (0.1.28) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New diagnostic tool: sudo bb-kilit-tani [--onar] [--usb]. Checks files,
    services, the verifier socket (also with the lock screen's own identity),
    master/portal sync and registration state; writes /var/log/bb-kilit-tani.txt.
  * Master/portal sync logs the error kind (HTTP code, errno) to the journal.
  * Lock screen: compact layout for screens shorter than 900 px (1366x768)
    and clearer verifier error messages (group not active vs service down).

